Conflicts: podman
Breaks: podman
Replaces: podman
Description: EasyTidy minimal Podman (easytidy fork of podman 6.2)
 Minimal podman engine for EasyTidy: fast same-mapping rebuild
 (incremental commit diff + easytidy_fast commit/create API parameters)
 and removal of subsystems EasyTidy does not use (machine, kube, farm,
 secrets, pods, manifest, quadlet, ...).
 Keeps the Docker-compat + libpod API surface and the CLI subset
 required by VS Code Dev Containers.
